    "body": "Coordinator triage. The red run is 44955923206 on ced4dc34e (#3033), runner wopr.\n\n- The one red step is `ui suites: egui_app`. The binary stopped in 0 s with `exit -1`. The log shows no test output, no panic and no assert.\n- This is the third failure with this signature: `ui suites: lib` on skull (273642212) and `ui suites: trace_parity` on egg (6ffa808ae) are the others.\n- The run on wopr overlapped a run on wopr-2 (a0fe9f1dc, 22:07-22:33). The two runners look like one host.\n- Classification: runner environment, not a code defect. No worker takes this issue.\n- #3258 tracks the cause: UI test binaries abort when gates run in parallel on one host.\n- This issue closes on the next green run.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
